                </div>
                <h1 class="article__title">Voluntary recommended public cash tender offer for all the shares and equity securities in Tecnotree Corporation (FI) – EUR 131 million</h1>
            </header>
        
        <div class="article__intro">
            
            <div class="article__meta">
                <div class="article__share">
                    <div class="share">
