        <div class="article__content">
            <div class="article__richtext">
                
<p>DNB Carnegie acted as sole financial adviser to the consortium comprising of Helios Investment Partners, Padma Ravichander and Fitzroy Investments, acting through Resilience Investment Holdings Ltd in connection with their voluntary recommended public cash tender offer for all the shares and equity securities in Tecnotree Corporation.</p>



<p>Tecnotree is a global provider of IT solutions for the management of services, products, customers and revenue for communications service providers. Tecnotree helps customers to monetize and transform their business towards a marketplace of digital services.</p>
            </div>

